    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a four-member special forces team. Assign combat positions, help your subordinates avoid enemy fire, and provide guidance and support on the battlefield. Call in drone and artillery strikes, designate targets for snipers and tanks, cooperate with various forces, and eliminate all nomadic savage gangs in the region. Defend positions, organize night ambushes, and launch daring strikes into the heart of enemy forces. Plan, command, and win, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: The player controls a unit of four soldiers: a rifleman, a machine gunner, a grenade launcher, and a sniper. As the commander, the player can assign combat positions to the first three soldiers, who detect and engage targets based on their own decisions. The fourth soldier, the sniper, is assigned specific targets and moves independently. The commander is also responsible for providing immediate fire support to the unit through artillery and strike drones. The player must choose the appropriate training plan for the unit, decide on the fire support type, and select the supply transport. Additionally, the player is tasked with requesting supplies and escorting the transportation and the unit through the battle zone.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a four-member special forces team. Assign combat positions, help your subordinates avoid enemy fire, and provide guidance and support on the battlefield. Call in drone and artillery strikes, designate targets for snipers and tanks, cooperate with various forces, and eliminate all nomadic savage gangs in the region. Defend positions, organize night ambushes, and launch daring strikes into the heart of enemy forces. Plan, command, and win, Commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: The player controls a unit of four soldiers: a rifleman, a machine gunner, a grenade launcher, and a sniper. As the commander, the player can assign combat positions to the first three soldiers, who detect and engage targets based on their own decisions. The fourth soldier, the sniper, is assigned specific targets and moves independently. The commander is also responsible for providing immediate fire support to the unit through artillery and strike drones. The player must choose the appropriate training plan for the unit, decide on the fire support type, and select the supply transport. Additionally, the player is tasked with requesting supplies and escorting the transportation and the unit through the battle zone.</p>",
    "short_description": "Bataliron is a modern warfare RTS game that focuses on personnel development, online command, fire support, and unit assistance on the battlefield, leveraging modern technologies.",
